OL,3,ALights will stay on this winter, grid
OL,4,Aoperator says after concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe lights will stay on this winter,
OL,7,Fthe body in charge of Britain's
OL,8,Felectricity network has said after
OL,9,Fconcerns were raised by some of its
OL,10,Fengineers.
OL,12,FThe National Energy System Operator
OL,13,F(NESO) said the country's electricity
OL,14,Fsystem was prepared and "resilient to
OL,15,Fthe challenges it may face" during the
OL,16,Fcolder months.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
